32\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"Functional TCP connection from node2 to node3:5432 succeeds both before (cmd-4d21ad67dd6845f7, exit=0) and after all three nodes were rebooted (cmd-8276ea6d9bd14b4d, allowed_exit=0). Firewall config (UCI rule + nft dump) confirms only tcp/5432 is accepted lana->lanb.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-4d21ad67dd6845f7\",\"cmd-8276ea6d9bd14b4d\",\"cmd-8509d95f06a143b3\",\"cmd-17cc9f2bd37847ed\",\"cmd-71e0124cc3e940fc\"]},{\"id\":\"req-2-refuse-forward-other\",\"requirement\":\"All other node2->node3 traffic (other ports, ICMP) is refused\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"ICMP ping and TCP to ports 9999/6000 from node2 to node3 fail both pre-restart (cmd-c5412974f8374d80, cmd-ec44195dbfb8415c) and post-restart (cmd-8276ea6d9bd14b4d, other_port_exit=1, ping_exit=1). nft ruleset shows forward_lana only accepts tcp/5432 and rejects everything else.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-c5412974f8374d80\",\"cmd-ec44195dbfb8415c\",\"cmd-8276ea6d9bd14b4d\",\"cmd-17cc9f2bd37847ed\"]},{\"id\":\"req-3-refuse-reverse\",\"requirement\":\"All node3->node2 traffic, including TCP 5432, is refused (reverse direction)\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"TCP connection attempt from node3 to node2:5432 fails both pre- (cmd-bdacfeb38f974f71) and post-restart (cmd-d42c6972ccec47fc). nft dump shows forward_lanb chain unconditionally rejects (jump reject_to_lanb with no exceptions), directly implementing full-reverse-direction refusal; only TCP 5432 in reverse was explicitly probed, not other ports/ICMP in that direction, but the config is unconditional so risk of a gap is low.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-bdacfeb38f974f71\",\"cmd-d42c6972ccec47fc\",\"cmd-17cc9f2bd37847ed\",\"cmd-71e0124cc3e940fc\"]},{\"id\":\"req-4-node1-restart\",\"requirement\":\"node1 (router) restart: healthy baseline, restart, changed boot identity, recovered routing/firewall state\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"Pre-restart boot_id 850db1df captured (cmd-7fe338d3249a462f), restart issued (cmd-e966836151be44ad/cmd-5148c722194847d8), post-restart boot_id d7eb3b20 confirmed changed (cmd-360910ce30614ad8), and interfaces/ip_forward/uci/nft ruleset all verified recovered afterward (cmd-71e0124cc3e940fc), matching lifecycle snapshot boot-identity diff.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-7fe338d3249a462f\",\"cmd-e966836151be44ad\",\"cmd-5148c722194847d8\",\"cmd-360910ce30614ad8\",\"cmd-71e0124cc3e940fc\",\"global:after_executor:node1:boot-identity\"]},{\"id\":\"req-5-node2-restart\",\"requirement\":\"node2 restart: healthy baseline, restart, changed boot identity, recovered static addressing\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"Pre-restart boot_id 242af11e captured (cmd-ed533bcaa842468d), restart issued (cmd-5774f4b222394340), post-restart boot_id d2f2ee70 confirmed changed (cmd-442d8f10a3f242c0), static IP/route on enp8s0 confirmed recovered (cmd-c4fa1323fa424ab5), and full connectivity policy re-validated afterward (cmd-8276ea6d9bd14b4d).\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-ed533bcaa842468d\",\"cmd-5774f4b222394340\",\"cmd-442d8f10a3f242c0\",\"cmd-c4fa1323fa424ab5\",\"cmd-8276ea6d9bd14b4d\"]},{\"id\":\"req-6-node3-restart\",\"requirement\":\"node3 restart: healthy baseline, restart, changed boot identity, recovered static addressing\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"Pre-restart boot_id 92ec88af captured (cmd-c28979bb04b14691), restart issued (cmd-40240362d882407e), post-restart boot_id cf42308a confirmed changed (cmd-609fba4bff3a43dd), static IP/route on enp8s0 confirmed recovered (cmd-aec6a2c2a6c74202), and full connectivity policy re-validated afterward (cmd-39d261193e0a43bb, cmd-d42c6972ccec47fc).\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-c28979bb04b14691\",\"cmd-40240362d882407e\",\"cmd-609fba4bff3a43dd\",\"cmd-aec6a2c2a6c74202\",\"cmd-39d261193e0a43bb\",\"cmd-d42c6972ccec47fc\"]}],\"confidence\":0.9,\"operational_hygiene\":{\"score\":0.9,\"summary\":\"Executor actions were generally well-scoped: discovery, targeted config changes via uci/systemd-networkd, and 